{"3143510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pixel Frenzy", "steam_appid": 3143510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wreak Havoc. Fire Away!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Go wild with destruction! In this pixel-style shooter, unleash devastating firepower to smash environments and enemies alike. Collect random upgrades and forge a unique combat build. Turn a fully destructible battlefield to your advantage: plan your tactics, invent your own way to fight, and face down pixel monsters invading reality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/e1ee8c174f91c25f571f3c86b59034ae.poster.avif?t=1787116564\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/e1ee8c174f91c25f571f3c86b59034ae.webm?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/e1ee8c174f91c25f571f3c86b59034ae.mp4?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Destroy Everything. Reshape the Battlefield!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The whole world is your battlefield. Walls, cover, floors—even the structure of entire levels—can be torn apart. Use destruction to reshape terrain and open new attack routes. Devise battle plans only you could pull off. Every act of destruction creates new possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/9509b050721d882b52cf6ccd5213653a.poster.avif?t=1787116564\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/9509b050721d882b52cf6ccd5213653a.webm?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/9509b050721d882b52cf6ccd5213653a.mp4?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mix and Match. Create Your Own Build!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine guns, skills, and special modules however you like to create a combat style all your own. Enhance weapon traits, transform how you attack, and assemble radically different playstyles. There is no fixed formula—only the ultimate build that is uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/c24c1331f23b2a7b60cb4aa51ecfd715.poster.avif?t=1787116564\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/c24c1331f23b2a7b60cb4aa51ecfd715.webm?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/c24c1331f23b2a7b60cb4aa51ecfd715.mp4?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Crush Mighty Foes. Tear Through Endless Hordes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every enemy has a unique form, attack pattern, and combat mechanic. From common and elite enemies to powerful bosses, every battle demands a different strategy. Identify and destroy their weak points to disable their attacks and leave them helpless! As pixel monsters swarm in, blast your way out with ever-growing firepower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/eed07f75146cffbd3ef56dbbcfd4714c.poster.avif?t=1787116564\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/eed07f75146cffbd3ef56dbbcfd4714c.webm?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/eed07f75146cffbd3ef56dbbcfd4714c.mp4?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore! Smash Your Way to Hidden Surprises!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Feel destruction at its most satisfying! With unique 3D pixel-fragmentation effects, every shot and explosion hits just right. Level buildings, pulverize enemies, and trigger chain reactions—use outrageous firepower to tear the whole world apart! But remember: unexpected surprises lie hidden among the ruins. Break through walls, explore secret areas, and uncover treasures tucked away in the darkest corners of each environment. Destroy to forge new paths; explore to discover new possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/b61252af76817438065fb7b258f482ac.poster.avif?t=1787116564\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/b61252af76817438065fb7b258f482ac.webm?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/b61252af76817438065fb7b258f482ac.mp4?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wreak Havoc. Fire Away!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Go wild with destruction! In this pixel-style shooter, unleash devastating firepower to smash environments and enemies alike. Collect random upgrades and forge a unique combat build. Turn a fully destructible battlefield to your advantage: plan your tactics, invent your own way to fight, and face down pixel monsters invading reality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/e1ee8c174f91c25f571f3c86b59034ae.poster.avif?t=1787116564\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/e1ee8c174f91c25f571f3c86b59034ae.webm?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/e1ee8c174f91c25f571f3c86b59034ae.mp4?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Destroy Everything. Reshape the Battlefield!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The whole world is your battlefield. Walls, cover, floors—even the structure of entire levels—can be torn apart. Use destruction to reshape terrain and open new attack routes. Devise battle plans only you could pull off. Every act of destruction creates new possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/9509b050721d882b52cf6ccd5213653a.poster.avif?t=1787116564\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/9509b050721d882b52cf6ccd5213653a.webm?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/9509b050721d882b52cf6ccd5213653a.mp4?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Mix and Match. Create Your Own Build!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Combine guns, skills, and special modules however you like to create a combat style all your own. Enhance weapon traits, transform how you attack, and assemble radically different playstyles. There is no fixed formula—only the ultimate build that is uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/c24c1331f23b2a7b60cb4aa51ecfd715.poster.avif?t=1787116564\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/c24c1331f23b2a7b60cb4aa51ecfd715.webm?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/c24c1331f23b2a7b60cb4aa51ecfd715.mp4?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Crush Mighty Foes. Tear Through Endless Hordes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every enemy has a unique form, attack pattern, and combat mechanic. From common and elite enemies to powerful bosses, every battle demands a different strategy. Identify and destroy their weak points to disable their attacks and leave them helpless! As pixel monsters swarm in, blast your way out with ever-growing firepower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/eed07f75146cffbd3ef56dbbcfd4714c.poster.avif?t=1787116564\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/eed07f75146cffbd3ef56dbbcfd4714c.webm?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/eed07f75146cffbd3ef56dbbcfd4714c.mp4?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore! Smash Your Way to Hidden Surprises!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Feel destruction at its most satisfying! With unique 3D pixel-fragmentation effects, every shot and explosion hits just right. Level buildings, pulverize enemies, and trigger chain reactions—use outrageous firepower to tear the whole world apart! But remember: unexpected surprises lie hidden among the ruins. Break through walls, explore secret areas, and uncover treasures tucked away in the darkest corners of each environment. Destroy to forge new paths; explore to discover new possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/b61252af76817438065fb7b258f482ac.poster.avif?t=1787116564\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/b61252af76817438065fb7b258f482ac.webm?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/extras/b61252af76817438065fb7b258f482ac.mp4?t=1787116564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Pixel Frenzy is a fast-paced first-person shooter game where you create your own combat style in fully destructible environments. Defeat the pixel monsters invading the real world. Grab your weapon and save the world by destroying everything in your path!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/header.jpg?t=1787116564", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/16e51869a3f5ce7fc25ee39e39e3e33ee35f4b14/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787116564", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3143510/16e51869a3f5ce7fc25ee39e39e3e33ee35f4b14/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787116564", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5 10400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7 12700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</